{"doc_id":"REPORT-news_r-01518-00001","summaries":{"A":{"adequacy":2,"critical_unsupported":1,"critical_omission":0,"wrong_unit_qualifier":1,"entity_relation":1,"fluency":3,"utility":3,"evidence":["올해 설날은 오는 25일로 대체공휴일을 포함한 연휴 기간은 24~27일이다","129개 노선이 대상이다"],"reason":"The summary says the holiday period was 'changed' (변경), which the source does not say, and the sentence that merges the date and holiday period is garbled. It also drops the 오전 2시 extension time, so the 129 routes read as if the holiday operation applies to them without that qualifier. Most other details are accurate."},"B":{"adequacy":1,"critical_unsupported":1,"critical_omission":1,"wrong_unit_qualifier":1,"entity_relation":1,"fluency":3,"utility":2,"evidence":["129개 노선이 대상이다","시내 5개 터미널을 경유하는 서울 출발 고속‧시외버스도 연휴 기간 중 운행 대수를 하루 평균 562대씩 늘린다"],"reason":"The summary wrongly says the 129 routes are intercity and express buses, when the source says they are city buses. It wrongly says the cemetery routes and the terminal buses run 'normally' instead of with more trips. It attributes the 오전 2시 extension to routes with two or more stops, which is distorted."},"C":{"adequacy":3,"critical_unsupported":0,"critical_omission":0,"wrong_unit_qualifier":1,"entity_relation":0,"fluency":4,"utility":3,"evidence":["지하철·버스 막차 시간을 각 이튿날 오전 2시까지 늦추기로 했다","오전 7시~이튿날 오전 1시까지로 운영시간을 확대한다"],"reason":"The summary is accurate on the main measures and is concise. It leaves out the 오전 2시 extension time. It also says the bus lane 'operates' during these hours without saying this is an expansion of the normal hours, which is a minor qualifier loss."},"D":{"adequacy":3,"critical_unsupported":0,"critical_omission":0,"wrong_unit_qualifier":1,"entity_relation":0,"fluency":4,"utility":3,"evidence":["종착역 도착시각 기준 오전 2시까지 운행한다","23일부터 연휴가 끝나는 27일까지"],"reason":"The summary is accurate and fluent. It omits the 오전 2시 extension time, which is a material qualifier. It also omits the cemetery and express bus increases, and the penalties."}}}
